RecallGuard includes and modifies code from "HNSW with Accuracy Guarantees"
(https://github.com/ming-afk/recall_certify_hnsw), released under Apache-2.0.

The original HNSW implementation is by Yury Malkov and contributors. The CRC,
LTT, and MBV research implementation is by Minghao Li, Raghav Mittal, Sanjivni
Rana, Suraj Shetiya, Gautam Das, Nick Koudas, and contributors.

App.nz additions: Cog packaging, safe exact-scan rectifier, synthetic demo,
in-process index cache, tests, and deployment documentation.
